        "text": {
            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-EDGE-PULL-SN\"><b>Laurey Edge Pull in Satin Nickel</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Satin Nickel Edge Pull installs with a low profile that will add a modern touch to your kitchen. The Edge Pull in Satin Nickel can be mounted horizontally or vertically for use on kitchen cabinet doors or drawers. Choose from an array of sizes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey Satin Nickel Cabinet Edge Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Nickel</li>\r\n<li>Package with 2 Self Tap Screws - 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 5 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LAU-96728:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-96228:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-96328:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 5-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-96428:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 8-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-96528:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 11-22/25\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
